00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.490
- So you're a grandpa as well.

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:03.610
And you posted this
video of your grandson.

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:05.080
So let's see.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:08.403
- Look who's on the TV?
Who's that? Look! Look!

00:00:09.404 --> 00:00:14.404
- Grand dude! Grand dude!
Grand dude! Grand dude!

00:00:15.761 --> 00:00:18.148
- Aw, what was goin' on
there? He recognized you?

00:00:18.148 --> 00:00:19.520
- That's little Sam.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.600
I don't know if it was the
first time he recognized me,

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.730
but that was the first time
I actually finally heard him

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:24.670
say grand dude.

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:26.970
Which I've been working on.
- Oh.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:27.820
- Did he say "Grand Dude"?

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.040
- Grand Dude. That's what he...

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.690
I know it sounds like grand nude.

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:32.864
I love that he's saying grand dude.

00:00:32.864 --> 00:00:36.950
Yeah, and I remember the
day I had done a broadcast

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:38.693
and it wasn't a great broadcast.

00:00:38.693 --> 00:00:42.310
I was feeling, you know,
eh, and then I get this text

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:45.540
from my daughter-in-law with
that video and I just melt.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.320
That's the thing about kids,
- Oh, I get it.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:50.850
it takes you out of everything
else going on in your life.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.230
Perspective is crazy.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.579
So I've been working
on grand dude with him,

00:00:54.579 --> 00:00:58.410
