to the fact that I'm older,

00:01:06.051 --> 00:01:07.814
but dude says I still got a little.

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:09.891
- But I'm cool. I'm the cool grandad.

00:01:09.891 --> 00:01:12.120
- So I've been working on
it and it's hard to say.

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:13.485
So that was so great,

00:01:13.485 --> 00:01:14.620
Yes! he said it,

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:17.253
